
TYPES: #eg-0308 tvpilot, televisionepisode, televisionseries

PRE-MARKUP:

Example of a television pilot episode.

MICRODATA:

HTML
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/TVEpisode">
  <h1 itemprop="name">TV Pilot Name</h1>

  <meta itemprop="alternateName" content="Other name">

  <p itemprop="description">A nice pilot.</p>

  <img itemprop="image" src="https://example.com/image-1.jpg">
  <img itemprop="image" src="https://example.com/image-2.jpg">

  <meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2026-08-30">

  <span itemprop="genre">Documentary</span>

  <div itemprop="productionCompany" itemscope
       itemtype="https://schema.org/Organization">
    <span itemprop="name">ComfortSeat</span>
  </div>

  <div itemprop="countryOfOrigin" itemscope
       itemtype="https://schema.org/Country">
    <span itemprop="name">Brazil</span>
  </div>

  <div itemprop="partOfSeries" itemscope
       itemtype="https://schema.org/TVSeries">
    <span itemprop="name">Thing</span>
  </div>

  <div itemprop="trailer" itemscope
       itemtype="https://schema.org/VideoObject">
    <span itemprop="name">Trailer</span>
    <meta itemprop="duration" content="PT1M33S">
    <link itemprop="contentUrl" href="https://example.com">
  </div>
</div>


